      "neuron-ion-channel",
      "synapse-synaptic-transmission"
    ],
    "engineering_link": "树突整合与突触分布决定了神经元的输入—输出映射，是脉冲神经网络建模的基本计算单元。",
    "references": [
      {
        "type": "textbook",
        "title": "Principles of Neural Science (Kandel et al., 6th ed., 2021)",
        "verified_at": "2026-10-10"
      }
