  {
    "id": "neuron-ion-channel",
    "module": "neuron",
    "name_zh": "离子通道",
    "name_en": "Ion Channel",
    "aliases": [
      "膜通道",
      "门控通道",
      "离子通道蛋白"
    ],
    "pinyin": "lizitongdao",
    "pinyin_initials": "lztd",
    "definition": "镶嵌在细胞膜上的跨膜蛋白，在电压、配体或机械刺激等条件下允许特定离子（如 Na⁺、K⁺、Ca²⁺、Cl⁻）跨膜流动，是静息电位、动作电位与突触电流的分子基础。",
    "plain": "细胞膜上的“小门”，只放特定离子通过；门什么时候开，决定了电信号怎么来。",
    "difficulty": "intro",
    "tags": [
      "神经元",
      "离子通道"
    ],
    "related": [
      "neuron-resting-potential",
      "neuron-action-potential",
      "synapse-receptor-ionotropic"
    ],
    "engineering_link": "离子通道动力学是 Hodgkin–Huxley 等神经元模型与脉冲神经网络的方程来源。",
    "references": [
      {
        "type": "textbook",
        "title": "Ion Channels of Excitable Membranes (Hille, 3rd ed., 2001)",
        "verified_at": "2026-10-10"
      }
    ],
    "updated_at": "2026-10-10T00:00:00Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "neuron-refractory-period",
    "module": "neuron",
    "name_zh": "不应期",
    "name_en": "Refractory Period",
